# Research of otelcol-otelbox (vault.v1 DirectorySpec). Agent-authored research uses
# the Kadmos `agent-artifact` kind, whose frontmatter contract the managed root
# declares; this directory only admits it. problem-cards/ inherits this contract.
# Bodies are immutable under the root default: a changed conclusion is a successor
# note that names its predecessor in `evolved_from`.
admits { admits { names { values: ["agent-artifact"] } } }
